content.thinking:
This s02 snapshot is a very early AF_XDP tree (circa 2019, v5.1-ish: `xsk_umem_consume_tx` returning dma+len only, no `xsk_buff` API, no tx_metadata support at all — the metadata API `xsk_skb_metadata` doesn't exist yet in this tree). The seed mechanism (TX metadata) doesn't exist here. So branch1 in s02 must look for OTHER UMEM-resident field re-reads:

Candidates in this tree:
